# expect: `when` cannot be written inside a `Scene`
#
# A `when` in node position is an anchored region the reconciler rebuilds,
# and a canvas has no anchors. `if` lowers to a ternary in the draw list,
# which is why it is offered instead.
choice Mood
    Calm
    Loud

state mood is client Mood starting Calm

view
    Scene viewBox is "0 0 20 20"
        when mood
            Calm
                Circle x is 10, y is 10, radius is 4
            Loud
                Circle x is 10, y is 10, radius is 9
